+# Design — agentd-persistence
+
+**Status:** draft
+**Date:** 2026-09-11
+**Requirements:** `requirements.md` (approved)
+
+## Architecture
+
+```
+┌──────────────────────── consumers ────────────────────────┐
+│ agentd::lock        identity::daemon      events::outbox  │
+│ (OS file lock)      (fence lifecycle)     (stage events)  │
+└───────────┬───────────────┬────────────────────┬──────────┘
+            │               │                    │
+            ▼               ▼                    ▼
+┌──────────────────── kernel-store (port) ──────────────────┐
+│ KernelStore · KernelTxn · KernelReadTxn · repo traits      │
