+- `cargo clippy -p kernel-store-sqlite --all-targets -- -D warnings` — clean.
+- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` (from `agent-os/`) — exit 0.
+- `python3 tools/validate_repo.py` — `OK: 250 markdown, 13 canonical ports, no link/schema/catalog errors`.
